# decode_large_batch.env: the 5 base-env keys the TEP8 decode (gen) role needs at mbs > 16 (steps above 128 tokens). The IBPL decode env
# never had them (its prefill role does); the gen rulers (gfs-t8c-f agg env) and the bs20-32 gates ran with them. Inert at <= 128 tokens.
# Source: E2E lane stack_e2e_v1w.env (e614179c) = stack_e2e_v1.env + these 5 (dieexp X312 root cause: > 128-token steps fell back to
# unfused finalize AR / sampler / norm-gate). FULL_ROUTING_TORCH_ORDER stays 0 (W2, gated) -- set in w256_W6.env.
MUSESPARK_OPEN_FULL_ROUTING_ALL_BATCHES=1
MUSESPARK_OPEN_FUSED_FINALIZE_AR_CHUNKED=1
MUSESPARK_OPEN_LARGE_FINALIZE_SPARSE=1
MUSESPARK_OPEN_LARGE_NORM_GATE=1
MUSESPARK_OPEN_LARGE_PREPARE_OVERLAP=1
